{"id": "31655", "title": "虹", "author": "茅盾", "category": "文学名著", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/31/31655.htm", "intro": "《虹》是茅盾1929年创作的一部长篇小说，文中塑造了一位经过许多曲折，终于走上革命道路的青年知识分子形。这部小说通过主人公的生活道路，揭示了从“五四”到“五卅”这一历史时期内知识分子由个人主义到集体主义、由封建制度叛逆者到革命者的艰苦历程。这部小说充分说明了茅盾是一个理性主义很强的作家。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31655", "chapters": [{"title": "第一节", "file": "2045756.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "2045757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节", "file": "2045758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节", "file": "2045759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节", "file": "2045760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节", "file": "2045761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节", "file": "2045762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八节", "file": "2045763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九节", "file": "2045764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十节", "file": "2045765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "跋", "file": "2045766.html", "available": false}]}